{
  "_note": "Recorded foley for the Farmhouse, played in place of the synthesized takes. One file is one whole sound. steps: a walk across a ceiling, heard from the room below (about six seconds). knock: one knuckle on a wooden table, heard from under it. creak: a floorboard or a hinge. floor: boards taking weight under a table. house: one long groan of old timber. latch: an iron cellar latch lifting and dropping. breath: one slow breath close to a microphone. Name the files here, 2 to 4 of each; plain file names only. scratch: nails dragged slowly along the underside of a wooden table, three or four strokes. knocks, light, near, stairs, door, shut, chair, thud, nails, drag, gasp, rattle, glass, chime are the demon's sounds (game.js playSfx; audio.js A.rec places each one); match is the struck match on the title, snuff a candle going out, slam the planchette landing hard.",
